; Sounds that play at a player sound level besides the effects level, set from the sound mixer
; One file per line relative to sounds\, without .ogg, a trailing * takes every file under that prefix
; Rain, weather ambients and thunder take the weather level from the engine, shots and explosions the gunfire level
; A file in more than one section takes the first of weather, voices, mutants and ambience

[weather]
; wind loops the weather scripts play as beds
nature\wind_storm*
ambient\wind_*

[voices]
; stalker speech, dialogs and story lines, and the stalker barks kept with the mutants
characters_voice\*
monsters\human\*
monsters\stalker\*

[mutants]
; one folder per mutant
monsters\*

[ambience]
; ambient loops and one-shots from scripts and level sound sources
ambient\*
ambience_exp\*
nature\*
